==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Celestial Storm|Torchic|26}} from the {{TCG|Celestial Storm}} expansion; both cards have the Peck attack.
*{{m|Peck}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Torchic}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Y}}.

